Subject: [PATCH 1/3] xfs: annotate struct xfs_attr_list_context with __counted_by_ptr
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 14:09:06 +0200
Message-ID: <20260427120908.52254-2-aalbersh@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.51.2
